    "Exact parameterized known-Work-ID claim, reclaim and renewal source only. Historical SQL evidence supports the database guards and scopes.",
    "The Node model substitutes the transaction boundary and does not open sockets or execute SQL. Actual PostgreSQL RETURNING, dropped acknowledgments, concurrency and row/receipt behavior remain to be observed in a fresh reviewed Cloud run.",
